      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2018 Wiley-VCH Verlag GmbH & Co. KGaA, Weinheim.",
        "AbstractText": "An 8-step, gram-scale synthesis of the (-)-sparteine surrogate (22\u2009% yield, with just 3 chromatographic purifications) and a 10-step, gram-scale synthesis of (-)-sparteine (31\u2009% yield) are reported. Both syntheses proceed with complete diastereocontrol and allow access to either antipode. Since the syntheses do not rely on natural product extraction, our work addresses long-term supply issues relating to these widely used chiral ligands."
      },
